{"4214790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cropacalypse", "steam_appid": 4214790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Has farming become too peaceful?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crops have come alive in this bullet heaven. Level up your character, unlock new tools, and adjust the harvest to farm as many days as possible! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214790/extras/6525eb1470ce57bb0f6ac92b7d316d02.poster.avif?t=1767576535\" width=700 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214790/extras/6525eb1470ce57bb0f6ac92b7d316d02.webm?t=1767576535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IT'S HARVEST TIME</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be ready for the crops to chase, spit, and squirt as you prepare your harvest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As every day the harvest increases with in quantity and toughness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your harvest or turn them in for keys </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn unlocks in the Crop Control Center to manage your harvests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214790/extras/df6f3605086735a9519994138cca8322.apng?t=1767576535\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214790/extras/df6f3605086735a9519994138cca8322.poster.avif?t=1767576535\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=250 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GRAB YOUR HARVESTER AKA W.H.E.A.T.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose two of six harvesters to take into the harvest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn each harvesters unique upgrade to boost your harvesting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath option so make sure you leave your farmhouse well equipped!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Has farming become too peaceful?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crops have come alive in this bullet heaven. Level up your character, unlock new tools, and adjust the harvest to farm as many days as possible! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214790/extras/6525eb1470ce57bb0f6ac92b7d316d02.poster.avif?t=1767576535\" width=700 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214790/extras/6525eb1470ce57bb0f6ac92b7d316d02.webm?t=1767576535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IT'S HARVEST TIME</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be ready for the crops to chase, spit, and squirt as you prepare your harvest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As every day the harvest increases with in quantity and toughness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your harvest or turn them in for keys </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn unlocks in the Crop Control Center to manage your harvests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214790/extras/df6f3605086735a9519994138cca8322.apng?t=1767576535\"><img src=\"https